## Event Description

<!-- Event Description Start -->

Build with Cursor: An Evening of Agentic Coding
​Join a small group of builders to explore the shift from simple autocomplete to agentic programming. Whether you're curious about the hype or ready to sharpen your AI-assisted workflow, this session is for you.

​What we'll cover:

- ​The Paradigm Shift: How "agentic" coding differs from traditional IDEs and copy-paste.
- ​Cursor Fundamentals: A primer on the core features (UI, Indexing, Chat Modes, and Models).
- ​Real-World Workflows: Live demos of moving from a blank page to a functional feature using AI agents.
- ​Hands-on Building: Apply these workflows to your own projects in real-time.

​Bring your laptop! We're learning by doing. See you there!

